<title>FINLAND: ESTONIA-FOREKSPANK TO LAUNCH SYNDICATED LOAN.</title>
<headline>ESTONIA-FOREKSPANK TO LAUNCH SYNDICATED LOAN.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Estonia's Forekspank said on Tuesday that it was working to launch a syndicated loan worth 20 to 30 million German marks.</p>
<p>&quot;We are working with a syndicated loan project in the international money markets worth 20 to 30 million German marks,&quot; Forekspank's chairman Ivar Lukk told Reuters at a Baltic investment conference in the Finnish capital.</p>
<p>&quot;It could take place this year, and no longer than three years from now,&quot; he said.</p>
<p>--Patrick Lannin, +371 9 356 187</p>
</text>
